    ('Farli', 'female', '', 'Koko', 2025, array['https://i.ibb.co/2YvYtBJ/blank-image-min.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan.', ''),
    ('Remy', 'male', '41195', 'Engeltjie', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/Q90b47c/remy-engeltjie-may2024.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Nov 2023. History unknown, was with Samber at Chimp Eden for a few days before coming to VMF. Arrived with broken left arm which delayed his move to foster-mums. Integrated with Duimpie as a soft-release due to lack of bond to foster-mums, although often looked after by Gladys.', ''),
    ('Duimpie', 'female', '41225', 'Engeltjie', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/chtSfPC/duimpie-engeltjie-apr2024-temp.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Dec 2023. Mother was killed by dogs and Duimpie was then kept as a pet for 3 months. Integrated with Remy as a soft-release due to lack of bond to foster-mums, although often looked after by Gladys', ''),
    ('Aer', 'female', '21532', 'Engeltjie', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/23q5wTb/aer-engeltjie-sept2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was hit & killed by a car in Hoedspruit. Fostered by Bisou', 'Ears stick out, wavy brow, pale silhouettes under eyes'),
    ('April', 'female', '26465', 'Engeltjie', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/xCLxPdb/april-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone next to a road and kept for 2 weeks before handing in. Fostered by Bisou.', 'Small dark face with pointy chin, curved brow'),
    ('Babetjie', 'female', '1598', 'Engeltjie', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/m0dp5MS/babetjie-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Lizzie (ex-alpha-female, deceased). Name means ‘little baby’ in Afrikaans. High ranked.', 'Very thick tail, high head, not many distinctive features'),
    ('Bisou', 'female', '1036', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/pKktvB7/bisou-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born approx 2010 on site to Jessie. Excellent foster-mum and very good-natured. Fostered April, Howey, Sky King, Momo', 'Largest female in troop, very flat and dark face with puffy and baggy eyes, right eye has a faint dot on the eyelid, broken middle finger on right hand'),
    ('Bloem', 'female', '', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/FKy1rJR/bloem-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born approx 2010 on site to Brownie (deceased). Low-ranked', 'Very similar to her sister Poiny Face except tail isn’t as kinked, golden-brown and trim coat, small and slender, white mark on right cheek, small round face'),
    ('Braveheart', 'male', '1348', 'Engeltjie', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/RP9g3dV/braveheart-engeltjie-sep0223-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, found on the side of the road clinging to dead mother. Fostered by Gremlin', 'Very narrow and dark face with straight brow, flashes above eyes visible when he eyebrows, not many distinguishing features'),
    ('Brunswick', 'male', '1351', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/p1WYJV9/brunswick-engeltjie-feb2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Puma (deceased)', 'Peak in head, slightly golden, walks tall with straight arms, smallish head compared to body, low, overhanging brow with a very slight peak in middle, kinks in finger of left hand, his tail has a particular shape'),
    ('Buckingham', 'male', '1636', 'Engeltjie', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/4F4DXdL/buckingham-engeltjie-nodate-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Aurora (deceased)', 'Large male, long face wispy overhanging brow, white moustache, tail is long, has a couple of of kinks and is missing black tip due to injury, scar / bald patch on left knee'),
    ('Carolyn', 'female', '1335', 'Engeltjie', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/3p1ZBfR/carolyn-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, found clinging to dead mother on road. Fostered by Emma (deceased).', 'Large stocky body, darker-grey coat, small gap in lips exposing teeth, broad face'),
    ('Cleo', 'female', '26696', 'Engeltjie', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/Q6VGkVd/cleo-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed by car, Cleo was picked up and brought straight here. Fostered by Whisper, then by Lexie in troop.', 'Wispy hair on sides of face, lines under eyes'),
    ('Coco', 'male', '26801', 'Engeltjie', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/Jk8Ty8t/coco-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone on a farm at only a few days old. Fostered by Whisper in introcage, then looked after by numerous others in troop, mostly Maggie.', 'Less fluffy compared to Cleo'),
    ('Elliot', 'male', '20021', 'Engeltjie', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/jL9M0BT/elliot-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Bisou.', 'Very light-grey coat, broad and wide mouth, curved bushy brow, doesn’t like to look at people, looks like Leo but lighter coat'),
    ('Envi', 'female', '21462', 'Engeltjie', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/86dGVV3/envi-engeltjie-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as a juvenile in 2017, rescued pet. Integrated in September 2017. Low-ranked.', 'Uniformly scruffy coat with light brown-coloured patches on sides of lower back, quite a large female but very low-ranked, dark face with curved brow, quite elusive and can be hard to find'),
    ('Finland', 'male', '31596', 'Engeltjie', 2006, array['https://i.ibb.co/ZW5hwXf/finland-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Alpha-male', 'Large and very fluffy male, very light-coloured coat on front, parting on head'),
    ('Freya', 'female', '21502', 'Engeltjie', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/qgw2PtX/freya-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot by a farmer', 'Wispy hair on sides of face, dark face'),
    ('Gordon', 'male', '', 'Engeltjie', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/8j4xPfx/gordon-engeltjie-feb2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, found in Botswana. Fostered by Aurora (deceased)', 'Thin but hard silhouettes around eyes (not as pronounced as Jommy), low straight and bushy brow, very light-grey coat, scar underside of jaw, some red colour by his eyes'),
    ('Gremlin', 'female', '1958', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/xzBmfkp/gremlin-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born approx 2010 on site to Jessie', 'One eye looks a little off, very similar to Jessie with similar slight hunchback but a little smaller and has a thinner face, will eyebrow people if looked at, light silhouettes / flashes above eyes that are visible when she eyebrows'),
    ('Hannah', 'female', '19970', 'Engeltjie', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/hsNRqnB/hannah-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an oprhan after being kept as a pet in a dark room. Fostered by Emma (deceased).', 'Very pronounced straight brow, grumpy and teddy bear face, looks like Nala but without the sharp peak in the brow'),
    ('Harry', 'male', '1079', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/VxJxn2V/harry-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born approx 2010, history unknown', 'Dot under right eye, golden coat with light-coloured front, very distinctive contrast between head and brow, break in tail, overlapping toes on his left foot, light mark on bridge of nose'),
    ('Hawaii', 'male', '1555', 'Engeltjie', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/58MgG2t/hawaii-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born approx 2010, history unknown. Very high ranked', 'Medium-sized, slightly short and very thin tail, broken pinky finger, small black patch on scrotum, curved brow, flat face'),
    ('Howey', 'female', '26688', 'Engeltjie', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/rsHPdXH/howey-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan from Johannesburg Wildlife Vet along with Dani, mother was killed in Potchefstroom. Fostered by Bisou.', 'Fluffy light coat, straight brow, rounded face, often with the alpha group, bigger than April'),
    ('Joey', 'male', '1635', 'Engeltjie', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/1sjzHsx/joey-engeltjie-jan2022-min.webp']::text[], 'History unknown.', 'Short tail missing black tip, very fluffy around face, half finger on left hand'),
    ('Jommy', 'male', '1334', 'Engeltjie', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/SRvhFj0/jommy-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan with wounds.', 'Very hard silhouettes around eyes (more pronounced than Gordon), curved bush brow, very fluffy around shoulders, looks some what similar to Joey'),
    ('Kaz', 'female', '1639', 'Engeltjie', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/Z1XSqvg/kaz-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Gladys.', 'Large tear in middle of left ear, 90° kink at the very end of the tail, small and slender, square flashes above eyes that are visible when she eyebrows'),
    ('Leo', 'male', '21572', 'Engeltjie', 2019, array['https://i.ibb.co/C0DhM2S/leo-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan', 'Curved wispy overhanging brow, looks like Elliot but darker coat, not ;any distinguish features'),
    ('Lexie', 'female', '1598', 'Engeltjie', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/vC9snhP/lexi-engeltjie-feb2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Elly (deceased) and was close to the alpha-group. Very high-ranked, usually with Pickle. Very protective of babies.', 'Very dark thin face with fluffy hair on sides, short and stocky body, very dominant behaviour, will eyebrow and head-bob at people'),
    ('Luigi', 'male', '26647', 'Engeltjie', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/ynf2JZt/luigi-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone on a farm at only a few days old. Fostered by Oprah.', 'Very round and dark face, chimpanzee shaped black part above eyes'),
    ('Maggie', 'female', '21570', 'Engeltjie', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/m64q6Nz/maggie-engeltjie-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan after being kept as a pet for 10 months. Fostered by Jessie. High-ranked.', 'Large fluffy and round head, tear on left ear, big forehead'),
    ('Mariella', 'female', '26747', 'Engeltjie', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/XtwKsQD/mariella-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone on a farm at only a few days old. Fostered by Oprah', 'Cute face, quite small, wavy brow, dark face slight pale colour below eyes, trim, short coat'),
    ('Marshall', 'male', '1539', 'Engeltjie', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/w6hPDtd/marshall-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'History unknown, prone to loss condition.', 'Large black patches on scrotum, distinctive flick at very end of tail, usually poor in condition, looks most similar to James'),
    ('Molly', 'female', '8318', 'Engeltjie', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/41MjkPY/molly-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, didn’t have a foster-mum but was close to Emma (deceased).', 'Light-grey coat, bald spots on tail, ears pinned back'),
    ('Mr. Miyagi', 'male', '21504', 'Engeltjie', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/fCNcrtd/mr-miyagi-engeltjie-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan after being kept as a pet. Fostered by Jessie.', 'Slight weakness in left leg due to old injury, dark and angry looking face with almond-shaped eyes, thick black part of tail'),
    ('Nala', 'female', '21501', 'Engeltjie', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/xsTHm57/nala-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot by farmers in Malelane', 'Grumpy face, looks similar to Hannah but has a sharp peak in her brow and is more light grey, little moustache'),
    ('Natsuki', 'female', '26610', 'Engeltjie', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/FmvfvV0/natsuki-engeltjie-feb2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone on a farm at only a few days old. Fostered by Oprah.', 'Wavy and untidy brow, thin silhouettes around eyes, quite fluffy, will eyebrow people, light grey coat'),
    ('Oprah', 'female', '1577', 'Engeltjie', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/v16Gb01/oprah-engeltjie-jan2022-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Aurora (deceased). Fostered Zebulon.', 'Stocky body, missing black tip of tail due to injury,curved brow, shiny part on bridge of nose'),
    ('Paddy', 'male', '26726', 'Engeltjie', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/8ByByZz/paddy-engeltjie-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone on a farm in Zeerust at only a few days old. Fostered by Babetjie.', 'Very light, almost white coat, biggest 2022 orphan'),
    ('Pickle', 'female', '1272', 'Engeltjie', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/sqTwqg6/pic-engeltjie-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot so she could be taken as a pet. Fostered by Kloof who later disappeared from troop.', 'Relatively small / slender, grumpy expression, often has wounds on forearms due to fights, yellowish and dirty hairs on chest'),
