    ('Sky King', 'male', '26646', 'Engeltjie', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/m4yfY33/sky-king-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was found alone on a farm, apparently dropped by troop who didn''t come back for him. Fostered by Bisou.', 'Light grey coat, a little scruffy, largest of his age group, slightly curved brow'),
    ('Stick', 'male', '21606', 'Engeltjie', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/dQtsk5m/stick-engeltjie-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan after being bitten by a dog. Tail amputated and leg pinned due to injuries. Fostered by Bisou.', 'Half of tail amputated due to injury, curved brow, long nose'),
