    ('Zebulon', 'male', '26662', 'Engeltjie', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/bFTSLbQ/zebulon-engeltjie-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Orphan, was found alone on a farm at only a few days old. Fostered by Oprah.', 'The smallest of the 2021 orphans, still almost baby sized, small pink pale moustache, usually with Finland, especially when throwing food, often screams and likes to show people he’s the alpha'),
