    ('Kent', 'male', '', 'Engeltjie', 2025, array['https://i.ibb.co/2YvYtBJ/blank-image-min.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan,.', ''),
    ('Manu', 'male', '', 'Engeltjie', 2025, array['https://i.ibb.co/2YvYtBJ/blank-image-min.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan,.', ''),
    ('Chaunguito', 'female', '1179', 'Skunkey', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/HgJjzzv/changuito-skunkey-jan2022-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise. Alpha-female. Doesn''t like the introcage but usually fosters a baby once they''re in the troop. Doesn’t come into introcage but will usually foster a baby once they’re in troop. Fostered Rene.', 'Will head-bob, eyebrow and stand up with crossed hands when stared at, smallish round face like Paradise, curved brow, yellowish hair colour on chest and inner thighs, often with the babies'),
    ('Greg', 'male', '8202', 'Skunkey', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/JryL9Jp/greg-skunkey-nov2022-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Pom.', 'Very large male, grey coat, low burved brow with white silhouettes underneath eyes, always one of the first to appear, usually found at top/Robert-side of enclosure, sits with legs open always watching around.'),
    ('Jambi', 'female', '1169', 'Skunkey', 2011, array['https://i.ibb.co/6spfngd/jambi-skunkey-july2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Jose (deceased).', 'Golden coat, curved brow with distinctive hard silhouettes around eyes, similar looking to Wahoo but more distinctive silhouettes, shoter tail, almost no black tip.'),
    ('Lee', 'male', '1880', 'Skunkey', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/YTCCJbp/lee-skunkey-jan2022-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop. Low ranked.', 'Light-grey coat, broken middle finger left hand, thick tail tip, triangular notch bottom of left ear, sometimes limps on left arm due to old injury.'),
    ('Maggs', 'female', '21580', 'Skunkey', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/TBGHp3Q/maggs-skunkey-jan2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Hawk (who became a bandit). Looked after Teft & Abu during foster-mum integrations. Fostered Roddy.', 'Fluffy, dark-grey coat, small pointy face, grumpy expression, straight and high forehead.'),
    ('Malawi', 'female', '21554', 'Skunkey', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/Sf8tsjV/malawi-skunkey-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Reggae. Looked after Teft & Abu during foster-mum integrations.', 'Golden-brown coat, flat face with thin white lines under eyes, similar looking to her mother Reggae but with a slight v-shaped brow.'),
    ('Martha', 'female', '1147', 'Skunkey', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/Sxqrqtf/martha-skunkey-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise. Good foster-mum, very calm and one of the only females who doesn’t get stressed staying in the introcage. Fostered Button, Daisy Mae, TK,', '“Paradise family” looking (small/squeezed face), low straight brow, small baggy eyes, dark face, similar looking to Pan but not as stocky, usually walks with tail up.'),
    ('Morris', 'male', '1325', 'Skunkey', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/tHmx4tN/morris-skunkey-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Hawk (who became a bandit). Low ranked.', 'Disinctive parting on top of head, “chimp” looking profile (broad and prominent round muzzle), triangular cut bottom of right ear, slightly droopy left lower lip due to old injury (difficult to see).'),
    ('Pan', 'female', '1851', 'Skunkey', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/B6NQhqV/pan-skunkey-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise. Looked after the 2021/22/23 orphans in introcage with Martha. Fostered Gio', '“Paradise” family looking, large stocky body, light-grey coat, protruding muzzle, “scorpion” tail tip.'),
    ('Paradise', 'female', '1878', 'Skunkey', 2004, array['https://i.ibb.co/DtbNKLS/paradise-skunkey-unknown-min.webp']::text[], 'Ex alpha-female. Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot by a farmer. Mother of Pom, Pan, Martha, Changuito, Paranormal, and Rocky.', 'Completely blind, greyish eyes with lost look, white mark on right cheek, good-natured and confident with people, will approach fence.'),
    ('Paranormal', 'male', '1071', 'Skunkey', 2011, array['https://i.ibb.co/84BF97y/paranormal-skunkey-dec2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise. Very high ranked.', 'Large male, small kink/flick and a bulb at the end of his tail, broken middle finger, dots on face, patrols around the outer enclosure a lot.'),
    ('Pom', 'female', '1127', 'Skunkey', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/WKb6QSK/pom-skunkey-aug2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise.', 'Similar looking to her mother Paradise, very disinctive plucked brow in middle, less confident approaching people.'),
    ('Reggae', 'female', '1864', 'Skunkey', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/r45FfBz/reggae-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Ringo (deceased). Looked after the 2020 orphans in introcage with Martha, but not since then.', 'Simialr looking to daughter Malawi, tear in middle of left ear (only female with this), very big eyes, very cute look, long pointy face, trim hair around face.'),
    ('Richard', 'male', '1011 & 1604', 'Skunkey', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/xfvxjmh/richard-skunkey-unknown-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Ringo (deceased).', 'Large fluffy male, missing part of his top lip, exposing teeth & gums, due to old injury, parting on head, back arched down.'),
    ('Rockie', 'male', '1289', 'Skunkey', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/vDgGFry/rockie-skunkey-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Paradise.', 'Large fluffy stock male, only one testicle due to old injury, often walks with tail held up, big fluffy head with curved brow, tick tail tip, usually found bottom of enclosure.'),
    ('Spock', 'male', '1010 & 1129', 'Skunkey', 2003, array['https://i.ibb.co/wSZ0DmG/spock-skunkey-nov2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan.', 'Small male, golden-brown coat, parting on head, lips show a bit of pink mucosa and tooth on right, dark pointy face with long shiny nose, “alien” look, very good-natured will approach the fence.'),
    ('Teddy', 'male', '1560 & 1649', 'Skunkey', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/2vYZpnP/teddy-skunkey-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in Camelot troop, became a bandit then jumped into Skunkey troop in 2014.', 'Distinctive bald patches on both forearms/wrists which appear black, has an overbite, mouth sometimes slightly open, low-ranked and sometimes difficult to find.'),
    ('Wahoo', 'female', '21524', 'Skunkey', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/QPXXN1C/wahoo-skunkey-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop. Not much else is known about her. Can be very difficult to deworm due to shy nature.', 'Very shy, stocky body, baggy eyes and long nose, quite similar to Jambi except much paler silhouettes around eyes.'),
    ('Rene', 'female', '26668', 'Skunkey', 2019, array['https://i.ibb.co/KDC9Z9g/rene-skunkey-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother suspected to have been shot. Was kept for 3 weeks by people who handed her in after being refused a permit to keep her. Fostered by Changuito.', 'Light-grey coat, slender, black face, slightly curved brow.'),
    ('Button', 'female', '26741', 'Skunkey', 2019, array['https://i.ibb.co/8sxZ4Td/button-skunkey-unknown-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found caught by snare and arrived with old wound around neck which had mostly healed. Fostered by Martha.', 'Golden-brown coat, thin body, narrow long face, thin white lines under eyes, straight brow'),
    ('Rox', 'male', '26772', 'Skunkey', 2019, array['https://i.ibb.co/wdNVp93/rox-skunkey-aug2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed by car, leaving Rox with multiple breaks in legs. Long 5-month rehab with pins inserted in both legs. Lost right leg due to complications. Very confident and entered troop on his own but was quickly accepted by the others. Fostered by Jethro in troop.', 'Missing right leg (see bio), peak in brow, trim hair, dark face, big almond-shaped eyes with white lines underneath.'),
    ('Punim', 'male', '26678', 'Skunkey', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/51q5zXC/punim-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born 2020. Arrived as an orphan, found alone in a leopard trap.', 'Arrived as an orphan, found alone in a leopard trap.'),
    ('Bru', 'male', '26751', 'Skunkey', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/Yf87V3m/bru-skunkey-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, found alone and handed over to VMF.', 'Distinctive white patchy silhouettes around eyes, a lot of white hair around face that grows from middle of cheeks.'),
    ('Roddy', 'male', '26664', 'Skunkey', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/72YGdyV/roddy-skunkey-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone at roadside, mother assumed to have been killed by car. Fostered by Maggs.', 'Golden/yellow coat, wavy brow (worried expression), short lines under eyes, slender.'),
    ('Kappi', 'male', '26642', 'Skunkey', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/NtHqddx/kappi-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, confiscated by SPCA and handed over to Chimp Eden. Fostered in introcage by Martha & Pan, taken into troop by Pan.', 'Still has pink around eyes and chin, white fluffy hair around face.'),
    ('Daisy Mae', 'female', '26746', 'Skunkey', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/6wJ3vcZ/daisy-mae-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born 2021. Arrived as an orphan, was found alone and handed over to Chimp Eden. Fostered in introcage by Martha & Pan, taken into troop by Martha.', 'Golden coat, dark face, similar looking to Roddy.'),
    ('Gio', 'male', '26685', 'Skunkey', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/qn056q7/gio-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was trapped in a snare. Fostered by Pan.', 'Low thin brow giving a grumpy expression, slender.'),
    ('Abu', 'male', '26791', 'Skunkey', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/74XvYLt/abu-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found covered in blood, umbilical cord still attached. Picked up from a lady in Rooikat. Stayed in introcage with Teft and Malawi. Went out with Maggs.', 'Smallest of his age group, small dark face, holds tail wavy when walking'),
    ('Josephine', 'female', '26659', 'Skunkey', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/VpPw006/josephine-skunkey-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found covered in blood, umbilical cord still attached. Picked up from a lady in Rooikat. Stayed in introcage with Winona, Shaney, Martha and Pan. Went out with Martha and Winona.', 'Biggest of her age group, very big eyes with widow’s peak in brow'),
    ('Winona', 'female', '26603', 'Skunkey', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/j86sSS6/winona-skunkey-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, farmer in Mapumalanga shot the whole troop. Stayed in introcage with Josephine, Shaney, Martha and Pan. Went out with Martha and Josephine.', 'Wide and dark, almond shaped eyes, shy nature'),
    ('Teft', 'male', '26791', 'Skunkey', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/D7kqWkP/teft-skunkey-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone in Levubu, was told he fell off a roof, story unclear. Stayed in introcage with Abu and Malawi. Went out with Malawi.', 'Straight brow, triangular-shaped dark face, round eyes, confident with people, missing left nipple due to injury'),
    ('TK', 'female', '41179', 'Skunkey', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/jJCSQdx/tk-skunkey-mar2024.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Oct 2023. Was confiscated by the SPCA in The Free State, no further history known. Very scabby on face, head and neck on arrival. Fostered by Martha.', 'Very fluffy head with high forehead, dark face, confident with people.'),
    ('Elora', 'female', '41180', 'Skunkey', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/C130wG9/elora-skunkey-mar2024-2.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Oct 2023. Mother was killed by a car. Took longer to release her than the others, but eventually went out with Jambi.', 'Still has some pink on face, big eyes, confident with people, often sucks her fingers.'),
    ('Anita', 'female', '41185', 'Skunkey', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/JFD3PyW/anita-skunkey-mar2024-2.jpg']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Oct 2023. Mother was shot in Lepahale a day before being picked up. Fostered by Pan.', 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot. Integrated with TK and Elora & fostered by Pan.'),
