    ('Ash', 'male', '1074', 'D&D', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/mB2TrSQ/ash-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, premature and with jaundice. Had left inguinal hernia.', ''),
    ('Barney', 'male', '26704', 'D&D', 2019, array['https://i.ibb.co/SnFVLsQ/barney-dd-may2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/Nr1jsWZ/barney-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was found at an airforce base, troop didn''t return for him and was handed in the CARE. Fostered by Hazel.', ''),
    ('Bowie', 'male', '21511', 'D&D', 2015, array['https://i.ibb.co/LxJdJGw/bowie-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed by a snare and he was living on a farm with a baby pig. Fostered by Precious.', ''),
    ('Candi', 'female', '26816 & 26682', 'D&D', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/TL5KC1k/candi-dd-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, story unknown, mother possibly shot. Handed over by JWV. Fostered by Cheyenne.', ''),
    ('Chane', 'female', '1114', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/qms5vwY/chane-dd-apr2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/F0gtkNr/chane-dd-jan2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived with Jessie. Very humanized, knows how to unlock door pins and likes to steal things.', ''),
    ('Chester', 'male', '1252', 'D&D', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/4Mg70vj/chester-dd-oct2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/VC05dQd/chester-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Honeybear.', ''),
    ('Cheyenne', 'female', '8563', 'D&D', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/68bWBWR/cheyenne-dd-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Malandro. Fostered Helea, Isa Maria & Okoye together as a group.', ''),
    ('Cotton', 'female', '1407', 'D&D', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/9g3z2SY/cotton-dd-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Malandro.', ''),
    ('Crumpet', 'female', '1441', 'D&D', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/KzsFJdT/crumpet-dd-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Precious. Very high ranked.', ''),
    ('Diddy Kong', 'male', '1245', 'D&D', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/4SGWgHv/diddy-kong-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Honey Bear.', ''),
    ('Edgar', 'male', '21509', 'D&D', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/gMfPwLK/edgar-dd-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was found being bitten by a dog and kept for 2 months.', ''),
    ('Emmy', 'female', '1622', 'D&D', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/6HwhQwz/emmy-dd-nov2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed in Agatha the same morning. Fostered by Ruby (deceased). Arthritis and toe-amputated on right foot due to injury, limps heavily on it.', ''),
    ('Fiona', 'female', '1588', 'D&D', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/yNPT4vf/fiona-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was shot. Fostered by Hazel. Double-amputaee due to injuries sustained fighting with bandits on separate occasions.', ''),
    ('Francis', 'male', '1134', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/P9ZrHVV/francis-dd-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. People claim to have found him in a box. Suffered trauma and used to put his foot over his head when scared. Suspected abuse. Part of the orignal D&D group.', ''),
    ('Frankie', 'male', '1190', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/YtjTc3p/frankie-dd-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found in a bush. Part of the original D&D group.', ''),
    ('Giovanni', 'male', '26820', 'D&D', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/zhBDVry/giovanni-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, collected from Moholoholo. Story unknown. Fostered by a Phylis,.', ''),
    ('Harold', 'male', '241222', 'D&D', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/ZxcpRjW/harold-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Feb 2024. Found alone on a farm in the Free State. Fostered by Chane.', ''),
    ('Hazel', 'female', '1156', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/ygWWQK4/hazel-dd-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Found still attached to her dead mother who was shot by a farmer. Very good foster-mum. Fostered Barney, Fiona, Lynda, and Nils.', ''),
    ('Helea', 'female', '26762', 'D&D', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/P9xxxj3/helea-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in a group from Johannesburg Wildlife Vet along with Okoye & Isa-Maria. Was confiscated, mother stoned to death. Fostered by Cheyenne.', ''),
    ('Hoppy', 'male', '1031', 'D&D', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/vBFqc09/hoppy-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived an an orphan. Handed in by the SPCA after he was found in the coal bunker of a train.', ''),
    ('Ildiko', 'female', '241217', 'D&D', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/SPX6NLJ/ildiko-dd-nov2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Feb 2024. Mother was killed by a car and Ildiko was brought to Moholoholo Widlife Centre. Fostered by Hazel, then also looked after by Crumpet in troop.', ''),
    ('Isa-Maria', 'female', '26758', 'D&D', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/4Twzq4f/isa-maria-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in a group from Johannesburg Wildlife Vet along with Okoye & Helea. Was found alone on a farm. Fostered by Cheyenne.', ''),
    ('Jessie', 'female', '1176', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/qJ375QB/jessie-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan with Chane. Part of the original D&D group.', ''),
    ('Kikinette', 'female', '1472', 'D&D', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/MCd0s6X/kikinette-dd-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Phylis.', ''),
    ('Kobe', 'male', '21551', 'D&D', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/K0Y777D/kobe-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, kept as a pet and was handed from person to person and sold in a sock. Not fostered by anyone.', ''),
    ('Lynda', 'female', '26635', 'D&D', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/Y863QcW/lynda-dd-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found clinging to dead mother who is presumed to have been shot. Fostered by Hazel.', ''),
    ('Malandro', 'female', '1045', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/LPBNVMd/malandro-dd-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Part of the oringinal D&D group. Good foster-mum. Fostered Cheyenne and Terk.', ''),
    ('Mamba', 'male', '1148', 'D&D', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/zZfs2yK/mamba-dd-may2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/4SFrm79/mamba-dd-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, reason unknown. Part of the original D&D group. High-ranked. Naturally slender but prone to loss in condition. Poor dental health.', ''),
    ('Meggy', 'female', '26785', 'D&D', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/s6z48Zw/meggy-dd-may2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/rHMZdBs/meggy-dd-may2024-2-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was found alone at a nature reserve. Fostered by Phylis.', ''),
    ('Merlin', 'male', '21579', 'D&D', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/RD4HFhm/merlin-dd-nov2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan via Moholoholo and was extremely underweight and dehydrated. Fostered by Phylis.', ''),
    ('Mia', 'female', '241211', 'D&D', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/68B9Qb7/mia-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Jan 2024. History unknown but was kept as a pet for at least a month before handing over. Fostered by Hazel.', ''),
    ('Mistletoe', 'female', '1066', 'D&D', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/PW1bvGh/mistletoe-dd-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan orphan. Was kept as a pet and raised with a group of kittens. Ex-alpha-female. Part of the original D&D group.', ''),
    ('Mortadelo', 'male', '26621', 'D&D', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/yYXgKDB/mortadelo-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, found still clinging to dead mother on a farm. Fostered by Chane.', ''),
    ('Nhala', 'female', '1120', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/JKbdzSp/nhala-dd-aug2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mum was shot by a farmer. Part of the original D&D group.', ''),
    ('Nils', 'male', '26748', 'D&D', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/4NQ3m4F/nils-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed by a snake. Fostered by Hazel.', ''),
    ('Okoye', 'female', '26739', 'D&D', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/7RcGMH6/okoye-dd-nov2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, in a group from JWV along with Helea & Isa-Maria (D&D). Was found being thrown around by two large males. Fostered by Cheyenne.', ''),
    ('Phylis', 'female', '1228 & 1115', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/cb5mcYf/phylis-dd-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Found tied to a tree, looked after by humans for 4 months before arriving. Good foster-mum. Part of the original D&D group.', ''),
    ('Precious', 'female', '1121', 'D&D', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/GQwQ5tv/precious-dd-feb2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Found by neighbour, dehydrated with umbilical cord still attached. Current long-term alpha-female.', ''),
    ('Scritch', 'male', '1099', 'D&D', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/yPg17kW/scritch-dd-mar2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/1s61DnL/scritch-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an injured juvenile in 2010 after being found unconscious on the road with head trauma. Part of the original D&D group. Was alpha-male for a long time until Bowie took over. Very high-ranked although very calm-natured.', ''),
    ('Silver', 'male', '98224', 'D&D', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/QYWc1jd/silver-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Came in from the wild and we were unable to find his troop to release him.', ''),
    ('Skollie', 'male', '1093', 'D&D', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/dtLPxqz/skollie-dd-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was kept as a pet for some time. Part of the original D&D group. Can be very aggressive towards people, must be trapped before anyone enters the enclosure.', ''),
    ('Tammy', 'female', '1545', 'D&D', 2016, array['https://i.ibb.co/QQk7YWS/tammy-dd-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed in Tzaneen. Fostered by Honeybear.', ''),
