    ('Bembel', 'female', '1238', 'Gismo', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/JrHFKbT/bembel-gismo-feb2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Handed over by another rescue centre, mother was shot. Fostered by alpha-female Pointy (now deceased). Treated for pneumonia when young.', ''),
    ('Chloe', 'female', '1259', 'Gismo', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/YcJNt7R/chloe-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Fostered by Eva.', ''),
    ('Dottie', 'female', '21458', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/Z869Myx/dottie-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was kept as a pet.', ''),
    ('Eva', 'female', '', 'Gismo', 2007, array['https://i.ibb.co/yW2BnGc/eva-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site. Good foster-mum. Fostered Lew, Chloe, Mitch, and Ricky-Joe.', ''),
    ('Helen', 'female', '26624', 'Gismo', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/kSjxvcG/helen-gismo-mar2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, mother was killed by dogs a few hours before arriving along with deceased mother. Fostered by Poppy.', ''),
    ('James', 'female', '1321', 'Gismo', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/8rYTNb9/james-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Mary (now deceased).', ''),
    ('Keksie', 'female', '1195', 'Gismo', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/825YnR6/keksie-gismo-aug2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. A pet shop in Tzaneen took her from one of their workers who had been feeding her pap and grapes. Was very thin and dehydrated. Fostered by Tink (now deceased). Fostered Gabriel and Gizmo (now a bandit).', ''),
    ('Lolabean', 'female', '26691', 'Gismo', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/jhZJ8Tc/lolabean-gismo-may2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/Ln6h2r0/lolabean-gismo-sep2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. We were told she was found alone in a neighbourhood that have no vervet troops. Likely kept as a pet.', ''),
    ('Marcy', 'female', '', 'Gismo', 2018, array['https://i.ibb.co/6HW857Z/marcy-gismo-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to bandit Claire (now deceased). Joined troop after they both jumped in, but Claire later left again.', ''),
    ('Matilda', 'female', '1315', 'Gismo', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/x6WnB1W/matilda-gismo-unknown-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived in July 2013. A wild female who was kept as a pet for a few months. Her age is an estimate.', ''),
    ('Orchid', 'female', '1185', 'Gismo', 2011, array['https://i.ibb.co/yhB9Ytb/orchid-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Dave confiscated her from a lady at Checkers who was buying her glucose biscuits. Fostered by alpha-female Pointy (now deceased).', ''),
    ('Patchwork', 'female', '1910', 'Gismo', 2005, array['https://i.ibb.co/3TpJgk8/patchword-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan.', ''),
    ('Plotty', 'female', '1352', 'Gismo', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/8869BQw/plotty-gismo-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Alpha-female. Was born in troop to ex-alpha-female Pointy (now deceased).', ''),
    ('Poppy', 'female', '1243', 'Gismo', 2012, array['https://i.ibb.co/wyxzDHN/poppy-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as a1 year old in August 2013. Was kept as a pet, very humanised. Good foster-mum. Fostered Helen, and also Lolabean once she joined the troop.', ''),
    ('Pumpkin', 'female', '1211', 'Gismo', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/w6Kx2N3/pumpkin-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Kept as a pet for two months. End of tail is scarred due to getting it in hot oil on stove when jumping around as a pet.', ''),
    ('Ricky', 'female', '1235', 'Gismo', 2010, array['https://i.ibb.co/7Sm9MMy/ricky-gismo-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as a 1 year old from another rescue centre, together with Jamba (Goliath IC). Was very humanised and scared of monkeys. Good natured but will steal things if given a chance! Fostered Merlin (no longer in troop), and temporarily Scooby, Pumpkin, Lancelot, and Mila (now deceased).', ''),
    ('Schnapps', 'female', '1324', 'Gismo', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/1TC3G4b/schnapps-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Tink (deceased).', ''),
    ('Trisha', 'female', '21557', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/7NKD9Rp/trisha-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. History unknown. Very high ranked.', ''),
    ('Uh-Oh', 'female', '1919', 'Gismo', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/Ycc92tC/uh-oh-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Brownie (deceased). One of the best foster-mums, loves introcages. Fostered Little Biscuit (deceased), Chief Long Hair, Penelope, Matti Jnr, Spirit, Boogie, and Timmy.', ''),
    ('Abel', 'male', '1727', 'Gismo', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/xF86qJ8/abel-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Cane (deceased).', ''),
    ('Alvin', 'male', '21582', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/XVZgZgP/alvin-gismo-aug-2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was kept as a pet with his own bag of toys and very humanised.', ''),
    ('Benjamin', 'male', '20039', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/bLYcv9y/benjamin-gismo-may2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/1XHWZLr/benjamin-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Mother was shot in Musini.', ''),
    ('Booger Big Ears', 'male', '26759', 'Gismo', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/7z44sc7/booger-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Known as “Boogie”. Arrived as an orphan, was found alone in a forest beside someone’s farm. Was bloated & had sore bum on arrival. Suffered from peritonitis as a baby and spent time in special care. Fostered by Uh-Oh.', ''),
    ('Chief Long Hair', 'male', '21550', 'Gismo', 2015, array['https://i.ibb.co/4dZbbdg/chief-long-hair-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan after being kept as a pet. Fostered by Uh-Oh.', ''),
    ('Cory', 'male', '1326', 'Gismo', 2011, array['https://i.ibb.co/M8DfYgG/cory-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan, was hit by a car. Fostered by Kanook (now deceased).', ''),
    ('Denford', 'male', '20017', 'Gismo', 2015, array['https://i.ibb.co/bbk4Zf6/denford-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Treated for pneumonia as a baby. Began foster-mum integrations at Koko with Gabriel (his best friend), before being moved to Gismo due to injury (leaving the scar above his left eye). Fostered by Lew.', ''),
    ('Dylan', 'male', '19979', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/KzQs1nx/dylan-gismo-aug2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/D8vYm75/dylan-gismo-mar2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was found alone in a cow barn in Phalabora.', ''),
    ('Felix', 'male', '26599', 'Gismo', 2022, array['https://i.ibb.co/17hKswB/felix-gismo-feb2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/GPYyq2q/felix-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan from Johannesburg Wildlife Vet. Was found on mum’s decomposing body. Emaciated, old fracture on left upper humerus. Started foster-mums at James but moved to Gismo with Helen as he needed a friend.', ''),
    ('Gabriel', 'male', '21566', 'Gismo', 2015, array['https://i.ibb.co/KyZXRmz/gabriel-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], '', 'Arrived as an orphan. Was kept as a pet. Began foster-mum integrations at Koko with Denford (his best friend), before being moved to Gismo due to injury to Denford.'),
    ('Josh', 'male', '26798', 'Gismo', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/9g0Mvws/josh-gismo-apr2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/W0HvNwy/josh-gismo-dec2023-min.webp']::text[], '', 'Arrived as an orphan. Was bought from a market in Mozambique, kept for 4 weeks, then confiscated by someone who handed him over a few days later.'),
    ('Lancelot', 'male', '1188', 'Gismo', 2014, array['https://i.ibb.co/BBrLPnt/lancelot-gismo-apr2023-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/d7ZcNqz/lancelot-gismo-jul2023-min.webp']::text[], '', 'Arrived as an orphan. Was hit by a car and had lots of seizures on arrival. Fostered by Orchid.'),
    ('Michael', 'male', '1221', 'Gismo', 2008, array['https://i.ibb.co/d0Vswtx/michael-gismo-may2024-2-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/LtBmgdm/michael-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Born on site to Friend (now deceased). Used to live alongside the troop with mother, sister Scotch (now deceased), and father ET (now deceased). Integrated in 2012. 2nd chip 1207.', ''),
    ('Pokie', 'male', '26498', 'Gismo', 2020, array['https://i.ibb.co/4fnjSDW/pokie-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Found at a roadside neat Louis Trichardt with apparent concussion and tail wounds. No mother or troop seen nearby, but another adult monkey was found dead further up the road.', ''),
    ('Pye-wa-ket', 'male', '21571', 'Gismo', 2017, array['https://i.ibb.co/v1k6BWs/pyewaket-gismo-apr2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was with a family who said he was given to them by neighbours. Had oral herpes on arrival.', ''),
    ('Ricky-Joe', 'male', '26760', 'Gismo', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/h1Krqh7/ricky-joe-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Mother was shot. He was handed over to JWV who had him a short while transferring here as a group with Candi & Bobby (both now in D&D troop).', ''),
    ('Scooby', 'male', '1009', 'Gismo', 2013, array['https://i.ibb.co/JvGGKMS/scooby-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was being sold by the side of a road for R50 before being brought to the sanctuary. Fostered by Lew.', ''),
    ('Spirit', 'male', '26636', 'Gismo', 2021, array['https://i.ibb.co/swYWMbz/spirit-gismo-apr2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan. Was with someone for 4 weeks before being handed over to a capuchin sanctuary who couldnt keep him, so passed onto a friend who had him for 4 days.', ''),
    ('Timmy', 'male', '41197', 'Gismo', 2023, array['https://i.ibb.co/8gTc2rf/timmy-gismo-mar2024-min.webp', 'https://i.ibb.co/N6VJQxP/timmy-gismo-may2024-min.webp']::text[], 'Arrived as an orphan in Dec 2023 at approx 3 months old. Was kept as a pet for at least 2 months. Bought from a seller on the side of the road and kept in the family home. Very attached to people and his bottle. Fed cows milk and was very big for his age. Fostered by Uh-Oh.', ''),
    ('Tom-Tom', 'male', '1203', 'Gismo', 2009, array['https://i.ibb.co/hdVsTjn/tom-tom-gismo-may2023-min.webp']::text[], 'Born in troop to Brownie (deceased).', ''),
